AS(1)                       User Commands                    AS(1)

NAME
    as - assemble with the assembler of tcc

SYNOPSIS
    as [-o file] [-I dir] file

DESCRIPTION
    as assembles one file in the GNU syntax of the system
    architecture, x86_64 or aarch64, by running /bin/tcc -c.
    Without -o the output is a.out.

OPTIONS
    -o file   write the object to file
    -I dir    add a directory for .include
    -g, --64  accepted without effect

SEE ALSO
    tcc(1), ld(1)
